 cember 1\, 2026.\n\nDeadlines\nEarly career award application opens: 202
 6-08-06\nEarly career award application: 2026-12-01\nAbstract submission
  (oral and poster): 2026-12-01 (estimated)\nLate breaking poster submiss
 ion: 2027-02-10 (estimated)\n\nhttps://sirs.societyconference.com/v2/
LOCATION:Montreal\, Quebec\, CA\, Palais des congres de Montreal
URL:https://sirs.societyconference.com/v2/
